  <h1>Careers</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    We&apos;re not hiring right now. If you think you&apos;d be a great fit, send a short note and link to your work—we&apos;ll reach out if
    and when roles open.
  </p>
  <h2>Send your introduction</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:careers@functionfly.com">careers@functionfly.com</a> with a brief introduction and links to relevant work (or
    your CV/resume).
  </p>
  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your role interest (engineering, product, design, security, or operations)</li>
